-- A rule file that imports a shared file by its place in the PROJECT.
-- The leading / means "from the project root": the folder that holds
-- l4-project.json, which here is the example folder. The same line works
-- from a file in any folder of the project.
IMPORT `/shared/definitions`

GIVEN age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is an adult` age IF age AT LEAST `age of majority`

#EVAL `is an adult` 21
#EVAL `is an adult` 17
